Patch 0173: the buffers a client closes are handed out again instead of being allocated, wired and zeroed;
their pages go into the GPU's tables a physical run at a time instead of 4 KB; and the imported pages are
stored to memory once per group of SUBMITs (boot-arg sweetmalistore=1: before every SUBMIT, as before).
Boot 2026-11-28: on the widget page a CREATE_BO cost 7.1 ms and a SUBMIT 310 us against 53 us at boot.

